{"articleNo":"231319","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=231319&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [학자금]2019년 하반기 군산시 대학생 학자금이자 지원사업 신청기간 연장[11/15(금)까지]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.11.12","hit":"6223","attachments":[{"name":"2019 하반기 대학생 학자금 이자 신청기간 연장 공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=231319&attachNo=84184"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 200%; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2019</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">년 하반기 군산시 대학생 학자금이자 지원사업 신청기간 연장 안내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 200%; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">군산시에서는 군산지역 대학생들의 고등교육기회를 보장하고 재학기간동안 학업에 전념할 수 있도록 교육비 부담을 경감하기 위하여</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">「</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">군산시 대학생 학자금 이자지원 사업</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">」</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">을 연장</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">시행중에 있으니 관심있는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 200%; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">신청기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2019. 10. 18.(</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) ~ <span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">11. 15.(</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\